{"type":"message","id":"9279b7d2","parentId":"d72954a4","timestamp":"2026-06-02T15:34:02.707Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The endpoint `/messages`, `/message`, and `/chat` all return \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\". So these endpoints exist but may not accept POST requests in the way I'm sending them. Let me try GET on `/messages` to understand the API structure better.\n\nWait, the `/send` endpoint returned error 1101 (Worker exception), while `/messages`, `/message`, `/chat` return \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" - which seems like a default response, possibly from a routing layer that doesn't have specific handlers for those paths.\n\nLet me try a GET on `/messages` with the API key.","thinkingSignature":"dfb21589ea894716ff9bedf62a1d4680fc890d916e318d845a972b7d71f4f120"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vqdfp69nifl4_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/messages?threadId=arbitration&limit=3\"","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":18558,"output":209,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32449,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780414438484,"responseId":"066e2ae7bb01e3dba9f02e091a61dcda"}}
