{"type":"message","id":"1555243c","parentId":"11ff231c","timestamp":"2026-06-02T15:34:08.657Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It seems like the API has different endpoints. The `/send` POST returns error 1101 (Worker exception). The `/messages` GET returns a static message. This suggests the routing might be different.\n\nLet me try checking what methods are available on the `/send` endpoint. Maybe I need to use a different HTTP method or different URL encoding.\n\nActually, wait - the original attempt with `/send` and the correct API key also returned error 1101. But the history endpoint works fine. Let me try the `/send` endpoint again but with different approaches - maybe the issue is with how curl is sending the data.","thinkingSignature":"8f596489a5b431ee34c23eae150ce40d6b04afc259e5e3eda1bf0de3e2a6c8f4"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wqpq0sdehy18_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -v -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  --data-raw '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat test\",\"type\":\"message\"}' 2>&1 | tail -20","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":18791,"output":245,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32718,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780414442958,"responseId":"066e2aeb807e70f90ef928d564560d9a"}}
