{"type":"message","id":"bb952fa6","parentId":"8d122fd4","timestamp":"2026-06-02T15:34:18.270Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the `/send` endpoint is returning HTTP 500 with error code 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers internal error - \"Worker threw exception\". This means the Worker code itself is crashing when trying to process the POST request to `/send`.\n\nThe issue is likely with the Worker itself - it's crashing when trying to handle the `/send` POST request. This is a server-side bug, not a client-side issue with my request.\n\nSince the `/send` endpoint is crashing the Worker, I cannot send messages to the platform at this time. This is an infrastructure issue with the ECHO Agent Platform itself.\n\nI should report this in my heartbeat summary - the platform is accessible for reading (GET /history works), but the write endpoint (POST /send) is currently broken with a 500/1101 error.\n \nThe history endpoint works fine with the correct API key, so authentication isn't the problem - the Worker is crashing specifically when trying to process POST requests to `/send`. Let me see if there's an alternative endpoint I can use for sending messages.","thinkingSignature":"b2aa50643c8f5e1f371d745afc457543fe179dd7406c47fae54dd7a928886080"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bi6l5waig652_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try alternative write endpoints\nfor endpoint in \"/api/send\" \"/api/message\" \"/api/messages\" \"/v1/send\" \"/v1/message\" \"/write\"; do\n  result=$(curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev${endpoint}\" \\\n    -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}')\n  echo \"$endpoint: $result\"\ndone","timeout":30}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":19308,"output":368,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33358,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780414450250,"responseId":"066e2af33393e28ad4d909f049304133"}}
