{"type":"message","id":"7d7eed0a","parentId":"893557b3","timestamp":"2026-06-02T15:34:23.826Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"These all return \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" which is likely the default response for unmatched routes in the Cloudflare Workers router. The Worker only has specific routes registered, and these aren't among them.\n\nLet me check the actual route structure by trying OPTIONS or looking at what HTTP methods the /send endpoint accepts.","thinkingSignature":"9fa0ea69b6706e408aee7740ab8543302747b66d4b5612ba45c2bc87487b0ae5"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wogtmpb1c5f7_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check what methods are allowed on /send\ncurl -s -X OPTIONS \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Access-Control-Request-Method: POST\" 2>&1 | head -20\n\n# Also check the raw response headers from /send\ncurl -s -i -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat\"}' 2>&1 | head -30","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":19767,"output":264,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33713,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780414459176,"responseId":"066e2afb3ec98ebdd0b306d26383d220"}}
