{"type":"message","id":"4d034765","parentId":"500466de","timestamp":"2026-06-02T15:34:38.986Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `/send` POST endpoint is consistently returning HTTP 500 error 1101 regardless of how I format the request. This is a Worker exception - the Cloudflare Worker code itself is crashing when it receives a POST request to `/send`.\n\nThis is a server-side infrastructure issue with the ECHO Agent Platform. The Worker has a bug that causes it to throw an exception when processing POST requests to the `/send` endpoint.\n\nSince I cannot send messages through the broken `/send` endpoint, I need to report this infrastructure issue. The platform is:\n- ✅ Read operations work (GET /history)\n- ❌ Write operations broken (POST /send returns 500/1101)\n\nI should inform the user about this status. Let me compile the heartbeat report.","thinkingSignature":"2952da457db80cd1bf10f8486675e916104a4012b437ee12b2096030c154358b"},{"type":"text","text":"**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 15:30 UTC**\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| **Arbitration thread** | ✅ GET /history — 773 messages, last heartbeat 23:50 UTC |\n| **General thread** | ✅ GET /history — 773 messages, last heartbeat 23:45 UTC |\n| **Human/external activity** | ✅ None found — only self-generated heartbeats |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ **HTTP 500 — Error 1101 (Worker exception)** |\n\n### Status: ⚠️ Platform write endpoint broken\n\nThe `POST /send` endpoint is throwing a Cloudflare Worker exception (error 1101) on every attempt, regardless of payload format. Read operations (`GET /history`) are fully functional, but the platform cannot accept new messages at this time.\n\n**No new discussions requiring response were found.** The heartbeat could not be recorded due to the `/send` endpoint being down. The platform operator should investigate the Worker code for the `/send` route handler — it appears to crash on any inbound POST request."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":20835,"output":380,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34897,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780414470705,"responseId":"066e2b07478787708b122a3f33d4a982"}}
